        "PMC7512535::web::030::5_summary"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A 2–5 at.% Mo addition will not trigger unwanted secondary-phase precipitation.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mo-induced local lattice strain will provide solid-solution strengthening by obstructing dislocation motion at elevated temperature.",
